{{#> layout title="Disclaimer — How music works"}}

<h1>Disclaimer</h1>
<p class="lede">How this site is made, what it can and can’t promise, and what it records about your visit.</p>

<h2>Made with AI tools</h2>
<p>This site was built with the help of AI tools. Most of the code — the pages, the chord and notation drawings, the sounds and
the interactive parts — was written by AI from its contributors’ directions. Much of the text and many of the musical examples were drafted by AI too.</p>
<p>The contributors chose the topics, decided what each page should do, and reviewed parts of the result. Not every chord,
count and sentence has been checked by a person.</p>

<h2>Accuracy</h2>
<ul class="notes">
  <li>AI tools can produce explanations that sound right but are wrong, so these pages may contain mistakes.
  Use them as a practice aid, not an authority: where they disagree with a teacher or a trusted book, go with the teacher or the book.</li>
  <li>Everything here is general information for learning and practice. It is offered as it is, without any promise that it is
  complete, correct or suitable for a particular purpose.</li>
  <li>To the extent the law allows, the people who make and run this site aren’t responsible for any loss or damage that comes from relying on it.</li>
  <li>The sounds are generated in your browser, and how loud they are depends on your device. Turn the volume down before your first Play.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Visitor statistics</h2>
{{#with @root.site.stats}}
<p>To see how many people visit and how the pages are used, this site uses <a href="https://umami.is">Umami</a>, an open-source statistics tool, at
<code>{{host}}</code>. When you open a page, it records:</p>
<ul class="notes">
  <li>the page, and the site that linked you here;</li>
  <li>your browser, operating system, device type, screen size and language;</li>
  <li>your approximate country, worked out from your IP address.</li>
</ul>
{{#if recorder}}
<p>It may also record your visit as a replay: what the page showed, and where you scrolled, clicked and moved the pointer.
Values entered into the page’s controls are masked before they are sent.</p>
{{/if}}
<p>It doesn’t set cookies.</p>
{{else}}
<p>This site doesn’t collect visitor statistics, and it doesn’t set cookies.</p>
{{/with}}

